[[64,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3238025\">2710A35</a></p>"],[512,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238423\">5530A14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p>1. Unscrew bolt of intermediate drive shaft bearing support to crankcase\nsump.</p><p>2. Unscrew screws (2a) and remove intermediate drive shaft (2b)\nbearing support.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017748.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[512,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Mount intermediate drive shaft bearing\nsupport and fix it with its screws.</p><p>Tighten bolt of intermediate drive shaft\nbearing support to oil sump.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238423\">5530A14</a></p>"]]